  "Which of the map's four extra terrain textures to paint.": "选择地图四种附加地形纹理中的一种进行涂绘。",
  "Distance between the decals that make up a line. Smaller looks more solid but places more objects.": "构成标线的贴花间距。间距越小，线条越连贯，但放置的对象也越多。",
  "Levels the yard to one pad, blended back to the ground at the outline. Permanent.": "将场地平整为一个平台，并在轮廓处平滑过渡到原地面。此地形改动为永久性。",
  "Auto follows the space; north–south keeps the low sun out of the players’ eyes.": "自动模式根据场地布置；南北向可避免低角度阳光直射运动者眼睛。",
  "The narrowest road this zone goes on (m; a two-lane road is 16 m).": "此分区适用的最小道路宽度（米；双车道道路宽 16 米）。",
  "The widest road this zone goes on (m; 48: any).": "此分区适用的最大道路宽度（米；48 表示不限）。",
  "How the streets are laid out inside the area.": "街道在所选区域内的布局方式。",
  "Straight streets in a regular grid, aligned with the longest side of the area.": "直线街道组成规则网格，并与所选区域的最长边对齐。",
  "A collector along the area with branches ending in pairs of cul-de-sacs.": "沿区域布置一条集散道路，支路末端成对形成尽端路。",
  "Winding streets with cul-de-sacs and a few loops, like a suburban subdivision.": "蜿蜒街道搭配尽端路和少量环路，类似郊区住宅街区。",
  "Streets follow the terrain's contour lines, linked by gentle uphill roads. Needs sloped terrain.": "街道沿地形等高线布置，以缓坡道路连接。需要有坡度的地形。",
  "A radial centre with a roundabout, surrounded by organic streets.": "中心为带环岛的放射状道路，外围为自然弯曲的街道。",
  "Widely spaced collectors with a looping local street inside each large block.": "以间距较大的集散道路划分大型街区，各街区内布置环形支路。",
  "Collectors around groups of 3 × 3 blocks with car-free streets inside.": "集散道路围绕 3 × 3 街区组布置，内部街道禁止汽车通行。",
  "Rings that follow the shape of the area, joined by connecting streets.": "环路沿区域形状布置，并通过连接街道相互连通。",
  "A central roundabout with straight avenues out to the edge, optionally crossed by circular rings.": "从中心环岛向边缘延伸直线主干道，可选用环形道路横向连接。",
